 My Group:\n	Name: EDM\n	Location: KHRA 2-190\n\nObjectives:\n	Describe the
  significance of homeostasis in physiology and medicine.\n	Describe the ma
 jor organs\, organ systems and compartments of the human body.\n	Describe 
