 n\nMy Group:\n	Name: EDM\n	Location: KHRA 2-190\n\nObjectives:\n	Explain w
 hy we can observe individual differences in enzyme activity in human being
 s.\n	Outline the shared molecular basis for the various mechanisms used to
  regulate enzyme activity.\n	Explain\, in biochemical terms\, how competit
 ive inhibition\, allostery\, and reversible covalent modification affect t
 he activity of enzymes.\n	Define the term zymogen.\n	Explain how zymogens 
