 zyme activity in human beings.\n	Outline the shared molecular basis for th
 e various mechanisms used to regulate enzyme activity.\n	Explain\, in bioc
 hemical terms\, how competitive inhibition\, allostery\, and reversible co
 valent modification affect the activity of enzymes.\n	Define the term zymo
 gen.\n	Explain how zymogens are activated.\n	State different examples of p
 harmaceutical inhibitors of enzyme activity.\n\nView this event online: ht
