 me after the presentation\, we can always address questions that come up f
 rom the Story. \nCourse: MED 511\n\nInstructors:\n	Shereen Hamza (shamza)\
 n	Roshan Abraham (jrabraha)\n\nMy Group:\n	Name: EDM\n	Location: KHRA 2-19
 0\n\nObjectives:\n	Discuss how basic cardiac and pulmonary physiology can 
