 ersonal and professional performance.\n	Discuss how basic cardiac and pulm
 onary physiology can be communicated to patients to help clarify diagnosis
  and treatment for heart failure.\n	Describe how physician advocacy can as
 sist in the management of heart failure through collaboration with other h
 ealthcare providers.\n	Describe how positive self talk and goal setting ca
 n have an impact on personal and professional performance.\n\nView this ev
 ent online: https://calendar.med.ualberta.ca/events/198701
