 escribe the purpose of gluconeogenesis and identify the major organ in whi
 ch it occurs.\n	Describe why reciprocal regulation of glycolysis and gluco
 neogenesis is required.\n	Compare the physiological roles of glycogen in l
 iver and skeletal muscle.\n	Discuss whether insulin and glucagon would act
