 ted with transfusion.\n	Describe the pathophysiology of the following tran
 sfusion reactions: Acute hemolytic transfusion reaction\; Delayed hemolyti
 c transfusion reaction\; Febrile non-hemolytic transfusion reaction\; Bact
 erial contamination (BACON).\n	Describe the concept of transfusion safety 
 from vein-to-vein.\n\nView this event online: https://calendar.med.ualbert
